  "conditional_induction": [
    "The entry carries no heap owner from setup; borrowed byte slices and static tables are not converted into owners of their original backing storage.",
    "The concrete decoders, profile builders, proof backend and private AES provider construct their owning containers during the call using ordinary default allocation.",
    "If the pinned compiler/default allocator semantics, memory safety and stable active arena premises hold, each successful nonzero allocation originates in that arena; ownership-preserving moves and default reallocations retain arena ownership of live blocks. Empty/ZST owners need not allocate or deallocate.",
    "If the pointer reaching each compiled free predicate is that same live allocation pointer with its valid layout, the current ARENA contains check chooses arena release. The missing universal source-to-machine pointer correspondence is not supplied by this audit."
  ],
